# Local scratch dirs. These MUST stay ignored: Tailwind v4's automatic source
# detection scans everything git does not ignore, so an unignored browser
# profile (hundreds of MB of cache files) makes `vite build` exhaust memory.
.event-image-edge-profile/
.freebuff/

